  "description": "QOCKAX crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H78 Ho6 N12 O36,8(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.715-3.715 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.37-112.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho6(teaH)6(NO3)6]·8MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Ho(III).",
